    pa:quote "Trigger Reaction Emergency Stop Stop Category 1 Safeguard Stop Stop Category 2 3PE Stop (if a 3-Position Enabling device is connected) Stop Category 2 Limit Violation Stop Category 0 Fault Detection Stop Category 0 NOTICE If the safety system detects any fault or violation, all safety outputs re- set to low." ;
