    pa:locator "Art. 15(5)" ;
    pa:quote "Furthermore, where the machinery or related product presents a risk to the health and safety of persons and, where appropriate, domestic animals and property, and, where applicable, to the environment, distributors shall immediately inform the competent national authorities of the Member States in which they have made the machinery or related product available on the market to that effect, giving details, in particular, of the non-conformity and of any corrective actions taken." ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "shall immediately inform the competent national authorities" .

